Modification notice. SoloStone contributors have modified this work. The first changes were made in October 2026,
and the work changes with each release; the release date is the date of that release's last changes. The changes
include:
  - retargeted to .NET Standard 2.1 and made to run inside Unity's Mono;
  - removed the upstream xUnit test project, and the inactive Adventure, Tavern Brawl and old card sets;
  - added engine support for newer card mechanics (Tradeable, Reborn, Kindred, Dormant, Rewind, quests, locations
    and others);
  - added and fixed many card implementations and random-generation pools;
  - replaced the data-contract serializer, which the game's Unity build does not have, with our own codec;
  - changed how card data is loaded (see section 5);
  - added the offline pool catalog.
