5. Card data
------------

The card data file (facts/violet-hold-2026-09.json; one file per card set) holds card IDs, costs, stats, tags,
card names and English card text, taken from Hearthstone. The names and text belong to Blizzard Entertainment.
SoloStone claims no rights in them, and none of the licences in this repository covers them. They are here only so
the rules engine can show and play the cards. The file leaves out flavour text, artist credits and other
languages. facts/README.md repeats this beside the file.

Card names and card text also appear in our code and data files, as identifiers, in lists and in comments.

No Hearthstone program file, image, sound, font or decompiled code is in this repository or in any download.
The tested-client file lists SHA-256 hashes of a few Hearthstone files so the launcher can recognise a client;
a hash is not the file.


